      "name": "repo-cache-manager",
      "title": "Repository cache manager — the other caches, one lane",
      "description": "The merge manager's sub-lane for every repository cache other than Lean: LaTeX/PDF build caches, FHIR AST branches, generated-artefact and render caches, CI step caches. Says what it owns, how it finds each cache, when it refreshes one after a merge, how it reads drift in a cache's inputs, and what it watches for the merge manager. Use for \"the PDF cache is stale\", \"the build restored nothing\", \"who refreshes this cache\", and when adding a new cache to a folio.",
